--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored plugins
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository also vendors one third-party plugin under
`fde-toolkit/plugins/`. Unlike the design references above it contains
executable code. It is pinned to an immutable upstream commit, imported as a
reviewed subset, and its provenance — upstream URL, tag, commit, licence,
imported paths, and the SHA-256 of every file — is recorded in the lock file
beside its manifest. Re-verify it at any time with `fde plugins verify`.

4. ponytail
   https://github.com/dietrichgebert/ponytail
   Copyright (c) 2026 DietrichGebert
   Licensed under the MIT License.
   Pinned at v4.9.0, commit 356918eba965ee1eac64bd3a7f0dd02108350de5.
   Full text: fde-toolkit/plugins/ponytail/LICENSE
   Provenance: fde-toolkit/plugins/ponytail/.claude-plugin/fde-lock.json
   Imported: the plugin manifest, six skills, six commands, three lifecycle
   hooks and the JavaScript modules they require. Not imported: artwork,
   benchmarks, tests, translated READMEs, the MCP server, and the packaging
   for other agents.

